 "verdict": {
  "headline": "A single external actor at 40.80.148.42 scanned imreallynotbatman.com, found a Joomla install on we1149srv, and repeatedly chained path-traversal and time-based blind SQL injection against the search component over about seven minutes, with no confirmed evidence in this data that file disclosure or database extraction actually succeeded.",
  "claims": [
   {
    "text": "The actor first probed the site broadly with path-traversal payloads aimed at /etc/passwd and a .git/config request typical of pre-exploitation recon.",
